Pool data — terms of use

This directory contains machine-generated sampling output: YouTube video IDs, titles,
and coarse public metadata (view count, duration, upload date, embeddability and
age-restriction flags).

- These are statements of fact about publicly listed videos, gathered through the
  official YouTube Data API. They are provided AS-IS, with no warranty of accuracy,
  completeness, or continued availability.
- Channel and uploader names are deliberately NOT collected or stored.
- No video content is copied, hosted, or redistributed here. Playback happens on
  YouTube's own embedded player.
- Removal requests: open an issue or use the contact address on the site, and the ID
  will be added to blocklist.json and dropped from the served pool.
- Inclusion here implies no endorsement of, or affiliation with, any video or channel.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by YouTube or Google.
